From c9eccfbdec7ec81ee60f5df6fed83c2de9b9a8e9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Niccol=C3=B2=20Venerandi?= <niccolo@venerandi.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 19:11:43 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] applets/notes: allow keeping a note in a file of your choice

Notes could only live in a private folder, so there was no way to share
one between computers. A new Sync page lets you pick a file, for example
in a Nextcloud or Syncthing folder, which the note then reads and saves.

BUG: 417165
